 "Styles": "id,name,root,description,hp,energy,hand_size,on_turn_start,on_link,base_deck,evolves_to,evolve_xp,evolve_requires,color,art,source\npetal_storm,Cherry Bomb,petal_storm,\"Swarmer. A loud, fast, bubblegum-punk brawler who never stops throwing and opens Cuts by sheer volume. She and Vicki Starr have been trading insults since the arcade days. Draws 6 cards a turn.\",102,,6,,,\"ps_step x2, ps_jab x3, ps_kick x2, ps_slash x2, ps_flurry x1, ps_guard x2\",sakura_tempest,150,opp_kiko,#c8374f,,Claude\nsakura_tempest,Main Event,petal_storm,\"Showboat swarmer. Cherry Bomb with top billing, a spotlight, and the timing to match. Starts every turn with 1 Swagger and draws 6 cards. Unlocks the Elite finishers.\",102,,6,gain:focus:1,,\"ps_step x2, ps_jab x3, ps_kick x2, ps_slash x2, ps_flurry x1, ps_guard x2\",,,,#dba542,,Claude\nstone_lotus,Velvet Hammer,stone_lotus,\"Slugger. A torch singer who fights the late show: slow, smoky, and devastating. She lets you spend yourself, then ends the evening in one swing. Ingrid Kessler wants her spot on the bill. 4 energy a turn and 2 block at the start of every turn.\",74,4,5,block:2,,\"sl_stance x2, sl_palm x4, sl_slam x2, sl_wall x2, sl_throw x1, sl_breath x1\",jade_colossus,150,opp_marlowe,#7a3358,,Claude\njade_colossus,Brick House,stone_lotus,Counter-puncher. Velvet Hammer fully built: harder to get into than the venue and twice as unforgiving. 4 energy and 3 block at the start of every turn. Unlocks the Elite slams and guards.,78,4,5,block:3,,\"sl_stance x2, sl_palm x4, sl_slam x2, sl_wall x2, sl_throw x1, sl_breath x1\",,,,#9a5338,,Claude\n",
 "Cards": "id,name,style,tier,tags,follows,cost,effects,link_bonus,text,xp_price,upgrade_of,max_copies,art,flavor,source\nps_step,Blow a Kiss,petal_storm,Base,Opener,START,0,block:2,gain:focus:1,,10,,,,Pucker up. It's the last free thing you get tonight.,Claude\nps_jab,Lipstick Jab,petal_storm,Base,Light,\"Opener, Light\",0,dmg:1,dmg:1,,10,,,,Leaves a mark. Usually a red one.,Claude\nps_kick,Switchblade Hook,petal_storm,Base,Light,\"Opener, Light\",1,dmg:3,apply:bleed:1,,10,,,,\"Fast, thin, and gone before you feel it.\",Claude\nps_slash,Rhinestone Cross,petal_storm,Base,Heavy,\"Light, Opener\",1,dmg:4,apply:bleed:2,,10,,,,Sequins are a girl's best friend. Ask your eyebrow.,Claude\nps_flurry,Encore,petal_storm,Base,Finisher,\"Heavy, Light\",2,dmgchain:2,,Deal 2 damage for each card in the chain.,10,,,,The crowd wanted more. So did she.,Claude\nps_guard,Peek-a-Boo,petal_storm,Base,Guard,ANY,1,block:5,draw:1,,10,,,,\"Hands up, eyes open, smile on.\",Claude\nps_jab_plus,Lipstick Jab+,petal_storm,Advanced,Light,\"Opener, Light\",0,dmg:2,dmg:1,,15,ps_jab,,,Fresh coat. Same bad news.,Claude\nps_kick_plus,Switchblade Hook+,petal_storm,Advanced,Light,\"Opener, Light\",1,dmg:5,apply:bleed:2,,20,ps_kick,,,Sharper on the second pass.,Claude\nps_slash_plus,Rhinestone Cross+,petal_storm,Advanced,Heavy,\"Light, Opener\",1,dmg:5,apply:bleed:3,,25,ps_slash,,,More sparkle. More stitches.,Claude\nps_flurry_plus,Encore+,petal_storm,Advanced,Finisher,\"Heavy, Light\",2,dmgchain:3,,Deal 3 damage for each card in the chain.,35,ps_flurry,,,By popular demand.,Claude\nps_guard_plus,Peek-a-Boo+,petal_storm,Advanced,Guard,ANY,1,block:7,draw:1,,20,ps_guard,,,Now you see her. Now you're on the canvas.,Claude\nps_feint,Cherry Feint,petal_storm,Advanced,Opener,START,0,apply:exposed:1,draw:1,,20,,2,,She telegraphs the left. On purpose.,Claude\nps_cyclone,Rat-a-Tat,petal_storm,Advanced,Light,\"Light, Heavy\",1,dmg:2x3,gain:focus:1,,30,,2,,Three to the jaw and a wink for the cheap seats.,Claude\nps_leaf,Bob & Weave,petal_storm,Advanced,Wild,ANY,0,draw:1,,Any card can link after this one.,25,,2,,You can't hit a girl who's already somewhere else.,Claude\nps_bloom,Curtain Call,sakura_tempest,Elite,Finisher,\"Heavy, Finisher\",3,dmg:8,dmgchain:3,,60,,1,,\"Take a bow, darling. Someone will help you up.\",Claude\nps_hurricane,Standing Ovation,sakura_tempest,Elite,Finisher,\"Heavy, Light\",2,dmgchain:3,apply:bleed:3,Deal 3 damage for each card in the chain.,70,,1,,The whole house is on its feet. Except you.,Claude\nsl_stance,Touch Gloves,stone_lotus,Base,Opener,START,1,block:4,gain:focus:2,,10,,,,Manners first. It makes the rest so much more personal.,Claude\nsl_palm,Velvet Jab,stone_lotus,Base,Light,\"Opener, Guard\",1,dmg:4,apply:exposed:1,,10,,,,Soft on the outside.,Claude\nsl_slam,Liver Shot,stone_lotus,Base,Heavy,\"Light, Opener\",2,dmg:9,apply:stagger:1,,10,,,,\"Somewhere south of the ribs, a whole evening ends.\",Claude\nsl_wall,High Guard,stone_lotus,Base,Guard,ANY,1,block:6,block:2,,10,,,,\"Elbows in, chin down, one eyebrow up.\",Claude\nsl_throw,Last Call,stone_lotus,Base,Finisher,Heavy,1,dmg:6,apply:dazed:1; dmg:2,,10,,,,\"Bar's closed, sugar. Somebody get her a cab.\",Claude\nsl_breath,Smoke Break,stone_lotus,Base,Guard,START,0,block:2,draw:1,,10,,,,\"One drag, one breath, one long look at the damage.\",Claude\nsl_palm_plus,Velvet Jab+,stone_lotus,Advanced,Light,\"Opener, Guard\",1,dmg:5,apply:exposed:2,,20,sl_palm,,,Plusher glove. Same brick inside.,Claude\nsl_slam_plus,Liver Shot+,stone_lotus,Advanced,Heavy,\"Light, Opener\",2,dmg:11,apply:stagger:1,,30,sl_slam,,,She found the spot. She'll find it again.,Claude\nsl_wall_plus,High Guard+,stone_lotus,Advanced,Guard,ANY,1,block:8,block:3,,20,sl_wall,,,\"Higher, tighter, ruder.\",Claude\nsl_throw_plus,Last Call+,stone_lotus,Advanced,Finisher,Heavy,1,dmg:8,apply:dazed:1; dmg:3,,30,sl_throw,,,Closing time comes early.,Claude\nsl_thornshell,Cover Up,stone_lotus,Advanced,Guard,ANY,1,block:4; gain:thorns:2,gain:thorns:1,,30,,2,,\"Go ahead, swing. I bill by the hit.\",Claude\nsl_quake,Shoulder Bump,stone_lotus,Advanced,Light,\"Opener, Light, Guard\",1,dmg:3; apply:exposed:1,energy:1,,25,,2,,Excuse me. I said excuse me.,Claude\nsl_moss,Lean on the Ropes,stone_lotus,Advanced,Wild,ANY,0,block:2,,Any card can link after this one.,25,,2,,Let her punch herself out. Then dance.,Claude\nsl_avalanche,Ten Count,jade_colossus,Elite,Finisher,Heavy,3,dmg:14,apply:exposed:2,,70,,1,,She's never needed to count past ten.,Claude\nsl_monolith,Bouncer's Guard,jade_colossus,Elite,Guard,ANY,2,block:12; gain:fortify:2,gain:thorns:2,,60,,1,,\"You're not on the list, honey.\",Claude\nn_wind,Second Wind,Neutral,Advanced,Guard,ANY,1,heal:4,draw:1,,30,,1,,Smelling salts and spite.,Claude\nn_clear,Strike a Pose,Neutral,Advanced,Opener,START,0,gain:focus:2,draw:1,,25,,2,,One for the cameras. One for her.,Claude\nn_haymaker,Haymaker,Neutral,Advanced,Heavy,Light,2,dmg:10,pierce:3,,40,,1,,No subtlety. No refunds.,Claude\nn_rush,Rushdown,Neutral,Advanced,Light,ANY,1,dmg:3,energy:1,,35,,2,,Corner her. Keep her there.,Claude\n",
